{"id":"komisch","lemma":"komisch","pos":"adj","rank":625,"glosses":["comedic, comic, pertaining to comedy","funny, comical (chiefly dated, but still usual with certain intensifiers as in urkomisch, zu komisch, wahnsinnig komisch)","weird, strange, peculiar, funny"],"ipa":"/ˈkoːmɪʃ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9c/De-komisch2.ogg/De-komisch2.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"komischer","superlative":"am komischsten"},"examples":[{"text":"Bin ich komisch?","en":"Am I weird?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/695369","words":[{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"I"},null]},{"text":"Ist das komisch?","en":"Is it strange?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/695344","words":[{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the / that"},null]},{"text":"Ein komischer Typ sieht uns an.","en":"There's a strange guy looking at us.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"type"},{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},{"g":"at / on"}]},{"text":"Er ist manchmal komisch.","en":"He's strange sometimes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755315","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"sometimes"},null]},{"text":"Welch komischer Mann!","en":"What a funny man!","words":[{"g":"what"},null,{"g":"man, male human being"}]}]}